        "answer": {
          "short": "Dimensions: $14\\text{ m}$ by $6\\text{ m}$. Perimeter: $40\\text{ m}$.",
          "worked": "The path adds $1\\text{ m}$ at both ends of each dimension.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Length}&=12+1+1\\\\\\text{Length}&=14\\text{ m}\\\\\\text{Breadth}&=4+1+1\\\\\\text{Breadth}&=6\\text{ m}\\\\P&=14+6+14+6\\\\P&=40\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p13-q6-b-solution-diagram",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"pathFill\",\"hex\":\"FCE8D5\",\"reason\":\"distinguishes the surrounding path from the pool interior\"}],\"reference\":\"source page 13, p13-q6-b-solution-diagram\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{pathFill}{HTML}{FCE8D5}\n\\fill[pathFill] (0,0) rectangle (5.6,2.4);\n\\fill[white] (0.4,0.4) rectangle (5.2,2.0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (0,0) rectangle (5.6,2.4);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (0.4,0.4) rectangle (5.2,2.0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt,{Latex[length=2mm]}-{Latex[length=2mm]}] (0,2.85)--node[midway,above=2mm,text=black] {$14\\,\\mathrm{m}$} (5.6,2.85);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt,{Latex[length=2mm]}-{Latex[length=2mm]}] (6.1,0)--node[midway,right=2mm,text=black] {$6\\,\\mathrm{m}$} (6.1,2.4);\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
